 combine flights, hotels, or car rentals for a convenient and cost-effective trip to Switzerland. Consider traveling during the off-peak season (typically April and October to November) for more affordable package holidays to Switzerland.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 16:56:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>20 Best Places to Visit in Switzerland - Travel + Leisure</title><link>https://www.travelandleisure.com/best-places-to-visit-in-switzerland-11944717</link><description>Explore the best places to visit in Switzerland, including stunning lakes, iconic ski resorts, and medieval towns like Rapperswil and Bern.</description><pubDate>Sun, 22 Jun 2025 17:49:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Plan Your Trip to Switzerland: Best of Switzerland Tourism</title><link>https://www.tripadvisor.com/Tourism-g188045-Switzerland-Vacations.html</link><description>Get a taste of it all with the Grand Tour, a 1,000-mile route that takes you to the medieval old city of Bern, towering Jungfraujoch, the iconic Matterhorn, and 42 other must-sees.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:16:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Switzerland Itinerary: Where to Go in Switzerland by Rick Steves</title><link>https://www.ricksteves.com/europe/switzerland/itinerary</link><description>Spend most of your time in Switzerland getting high in the Alps. So much to see, so little time. How to choose? To help you get started, I've listed my top picks for where to go in Switzerland, and my plan for your best two-week trip.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 08:42:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Best Places to Visit in Switzerland for 2026 - U.S. News Travel</title><link>https://travel.usnews.com/rankings/best-places-to-visit-in-switzerland/</link><description>Discover the best places to visit in Switzerland. See which top destinations like Zermatt, Lucerne, and Zurich made the U.S. News travel rankings this year.</description><pubDate>Wed, 08 May 2024 14:42:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Switzerland Vacation Packages | Switzerland Vacations | Tripmasters</title><link>https://www.tripmasters.com/europe/switzerland/vacations</link><description>Travel between cities by train with one stop in Zweisimmen. Fully Flexible Itinerary: Personalize your hotels, transportation, and length of stay in each city. Easily add curated experiences to complete your journey.</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:38:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>The BEST 8 Day Switzerland Itinerary For First-Timers (2026)</title><link>https://www.jonnymelon.com/switzerland-itinerary/</link><description>The ultimate 8 Day Switzerland itinerary to help you plan your trip, including getting around, fun things to do, the best places to stay, and much more!</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 12:24:00 GMT</pubDate></item><item><title>Switzerland Budget Travel Guide (Updated 2026)</title><link>https://www.nomadicmatt.com/travel-guides/switzerland-travel-tips/</link><description>A comprehensive budget travel guide to Switzerland with tips on things to do, costs, ways to save, transportation, accommodation, and more!</description><pubDate>Mon, 03 Aug 2026 15:37:00 GMT</pubDate></item></channel></rss>